    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c27b3ab3c8@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation&nbsp;(NYSE:SYK) will participate in the 36th Annual&nbsp;J.P. Morgan Healthcare Conference&nbsp;on&nbsp;Wednesday, January 10, 2018&nbsp;at the&nbsp;Westin St. Francis&nbsp;hotel in&nbsp;San Francisco. &nbsp;Kevin A. Lobo, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, will represent the Company in a presentation scheduled for&nbsp;8:00 a.m. Pacific Time.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-to-participate-in-36th-Annual-JP-Morgan-Healthcare-Conference/default.aspx\">See full release here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
